<title>NETHERLANDS: DRAKA SEES STRONG GROWTH IN COMING YEARS.</title>
<headline>DRAKA SEES STRONG GROWTH IN COMING YEARS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch cable maker Draka Holding NV said on Wednesday it expected strong growth in the years ahead.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to realise a turnover of two billion guilders in the year 2000. Profit growth should grow stronger because our profitability goals are set higher,&quot; chairman Jan van Kesteren told a news conference.</p>
